rns `night` (bedside mode is on), `showing` (the clock is on screen now; it appears 15 s after a conversation ends), the hint, the hours and the local time.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"mode":{"type":"string","default":"status"},"start":{"type":"string","default":""},"end":{"type":"string","default":""}}}},{"name":"self.imu.get_state","description":"Motion sensor state of this device: whether it lies face-down (face-down mutes the microphone and announcements), gesture counts since boot, the last gesture (pick_up, face_down, face_up, double_tap) and its age in milliseconds.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{}}},{"name":"self.diag.simulate_face","description":"Diagnostics only: after delay_s seconds, handles a face_down (true) or face_up (false) gesture as if the motion sensor had detected it; with up_after_s > 0 a simulated face_down is followed by a face_up that many seconds later.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"face_down":{"type":"boolean","default":true},"delay_s":{"type":"integer","default":0,"minimum":0,"maximum":600},"up_after_s":{"type":"integer","default":0,"minimum":0,"maximum":600}}}}]}}}
